features
    CICDSystem
        mandatory
            Build
            UnitTest
            StagingDeployment
        optional
            IntegrationTest
            SecurityScan
            ProductionDeployment
                mandatory
                    DeploymentStrategy
                        alternative
                            BlueGreen
                            Canary
                optional
                    Monitoring
                    Rollback
            HotfixPipeline
                mandatory
                    ManualQAApproval
constraints
    ProductionDeployment => IntegrationTest & SecurityScan
    Canary => Monitoring & Rollback
    HotfixPipeline => SecurityScan